ability (4/5)(1/5)=4/25. Add the disjoint events: 7/25.", "topic": "Statistics, Probability & Data Analysis", "note": "Split from the original shared crop; original PDF visually checked and solution independently verified."}]}]$payload$::jsonb) LOOP
